<BaseLayout title="A few things to know — Pocket Puzzle" description="Terms for using Pocket Puzzle and its externally provided browser games." canonicalPath="/terms/"><article class="legal-page"><h1>A few things to know</h1><p>Pocket Puzzle helps you discover and open a small selection of browser puzzles. Each embedded game remains subject to its provider’s terms and privacy practices.</p><p>Games can include advertising. Their availability, loading speed and behavior depend on the provider and your connection. We do not promise uninterrupted play or saved progress.</p><p>Pocket Puzzle is free to use, with no purchases or accounts. Please use the provider’s own instructions while playing.</p></article></BaseLayout>